Cora Honeysap is an elderly orcish woman who keeps a stall at the open-air market in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]], at the far end of the stalls from the parking lot. The only manhole into the sewers within the market lies directly in front of her.

She sells raw honey she makes herself in a cramped attic, where she also keeps her bees and the planters of flowers they feed from. She offers jars of regular and lavender honey and one flavored with menthol, and keeps a rarer stock behind the stall. Her jars start at two silver. She wears a small raiment of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]].

She knows the [[Anti-Zorbon Taskforce|Anti-Zorbon Taskforce]] uses the manhole and names [[Org/Amber Call/People/Mr. Whiskers|Whiskers]] as the head of it. She warns people not to wear a tinfoil hat out in the open, because then the Zorbon's people would know. She does not make hard honey candies, though she has thought she might.
